Hi,

to get more collaboration on the dracut project, I created the "dracutdevs"
organisation on github.

So the main github repo moves from:

https://github.com/haraldh/dracut
to:
https://github.com/dracutdevs/dracut

for issues and pull requests.

If you are interested in actively helping out in the dracut project, send me a
note to add you to the "dracutdevs" org, so you can commit, merge PRs and work
on issues.

Thanks!

